Body: Very pale skin, shoulder lenght blonde hair, lifeless grey eyes, small perky tits, looks malnourished doesn't eat that much even after the settlement, slightly stunted height near 5'5'', tight virgin pussy, slightly long face which looks oddly sweet in the right angles;
